@CampaignApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### 1. Llistar totes les campanyes
GET {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns
Accept: application/json

### 2. Filtrar campanyes per estat ACTIVA
GET {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns?estat=ACTIVA
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filtrar per estat invàlid (retorna 400 Bad Request)
GET {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns?estat=99
Accept: application/json

### 4. Crear una nova campanya (retorna 201 Created amb header Location i { "id": "..." })
# @name crearCampanya
POST {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Campanya Prova HTTP",
  "pressupostTotal": 500,
  "dataInici": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
  "dataFi": "2026-11-30T00:00:00Z"
}

### Obtenir l'ID de la campanya creada
@campanyaId = {{crearCampanya.response.body.id}}

### 5. Consultar la campanya creada per ID
GET {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns/{{campanyaId}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Activar la campanya (retorna 204 NoContent)
PATCH {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns/{{campanyaId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estat": "ACTIVA"
}

### 7. Pausar la campanya (retorna 204 NoContent)
PATCH {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns/{{campanyaId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estat": "PAUSADA"
}

### 8. Reprendre la campanya (retorna 204 NoContent)
PATCH {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns/{{campanyaId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estat": "ACTIVA"
}

### 9. Intentar finalitzar manualment (retorna 400 Bad Request: operació no permesa)
PATCH {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns/{{campanyaId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estat": "FINALITZADA"
}

### 10. Registrar consum parcial (retorna 204 NoContent)
POST {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns/{{campanyaId}}/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "import": 200
}

### 11. Registrar consum final que esgota el pressupost (passa automàticament a FINALITZADA)
POST {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns/{{campanyaId}}/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "import": 300
}

### 12. Verificar que l'estat és FINALITZADA i el consum és 500
GET {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns/{{campanyaId}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Intentar reactivar una campanya finalitzada (retorna 409 Conflict)
PATCH {{CampaignApi_HostAddress}}/campaigns/{{campanyaId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estat": "ACTIVA"
}
